    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/doctor-physician/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Doctor Physician Theme is a modern, responsive, and SEO-optimized solution crafted for healthcare professionals, doctors, physicians, surgeons, pediatricians, cardiologists, dermatologists, gynecologists, dentists, physiotherapists, chiropractors, psychologists, psychiatrists, and medical specialists aiming to build a professional online presence. Ideal for hospitals, healthcare clinics, wellness centers, private practices, telemedicine services, rehabilitation centers, diagnostic labs, dental clinics, and multi-specialty hospitals, it offers a reliable platform for managing and showcasing medical services. Designed to support a variety of medical niches like family medicine, pediatric care, dental services, chiropractic therapy, holistic medicine, acupuncture, mental health therapy, and physical therapy, it includes key features such as doctor profile sections, health specialist listings, patient testimonials, service highlights, and contact forms. Integrated with essential plugins like Contact Form 7 for appointment booking, WooCommerce for online consultations or medicine sales, Yoast SEO for optimization, and Booking Calendar for patient scheduling, it ensures flexibility and performance. The theme also supports HIPAA-compliant forms, medical FAQs, privacy policies, and secure patient communication, making it ideal for medical professionals concerned about data protection. With a clean, retina-ready layout, fast loading speed, and mobile responsiveness, it delivers seamless performance on all devices. Interactive call-to-action (CTA) buttons, banner sections, and blog integration help share healthcare news, medical tips, and wellness updates. Whether you specialize in cosmetic surgery, cardiology, orthopedics, physiotherapy, or general medicine, the Doctor Physician Theme empowers healthcare providers and medical institutions to create a trustworthy, patient-friendly, and informative website that enhances engagement and strengthens their digital reputation."
    },
